Conclusion

This lab provided practical experience in capturing and analyzing network traffic using Wireshark within an isolated VirtualBox environment. By generating and examining ICMP, ARP, IPv4, and TCP traffic, I gained a deeper understanding of how devices communicate and how packet analysis can be used for troubleshooting and security investigations.

These are foundational skills required for entry-level SOC Analyst, Cybersecurity Analyst, and Network Support roles.
